# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Roblox place and model files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# These are binary (or enormous XML). Git cannot merge them, so committing them
# guarantees painful conflicts the moment two people touch the world.
#
# The world lives in AfterFall.rbxl on your machine and in Roblox Cloud.
# The CODE lives here. Rojo joins the two together.
AfterFall.rbxl
*.rbxl
*.rbxlx
*.rbxl.lock
*.rbxlx.lock

# Exported models/assets. If we ever want to version a specific asset,
# we can force-add it with: git add -f path/to/Asset.rbxm
*.rbxm
*.rbxmx

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tooling output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/sourcemap.json
/build/
.rokit/

# Wally packages (installed from wally.toml; wally.lock IS committed)
/Packages/
/ServerPackages/
/DevPackages/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / OS noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
.idea/
